File: assets/css/core.css
Feature: slide-fixes

=======================================================================
Section 1
OLD_SECTION
.vSlide.pos{
    transition: left 0.2s linear, top 0.2s linear;

NEW_SECTION
.vSlide.pos{
    transition: left 0.2s linear, top 0.2s linear, right 0.2s linear, bottom 0.2s linear;

REASON
slide accepts positionProperty: "right", but .vSlide.pos only transitioned left and top, so an
element slid by its right edge jumped to the end position. right and bottom are now
transitioned too. The duration is still overridden inline by the slide's speed.
